data: {"answer": "This place is the **Bar Inventory & ERP** room. It shows how every bottle is scanned into the ERP, where POS sales reduce stock and low stock triggers purchase orders. You can see systems like Point of Sale (POS), ERP, and Inventory & Purchasing here. The room highlights threats such as Insider Misuse & Fraud and demonstrates controls like Segregation of Duties to prevent one person from both counting and adjusting stock.", "go": [{"key": "corridor", "en": "Staff Corridor & Physical Security", "zh": "員工走廊與實體安全", "base_en": "Corridor", "base_zh": "走廊", "url": "https://livetour.istaging.com/6a1e0bab-b805-4788-935b-97a06a024613?index=5", "tour": "A", "why_en": "Next in the story", "why_zh": "故事的下一站"}], "followups": [{"text": "What does the Point of Sale (POS) do?", "en": "What does the Point of Sale (POS) do?", "zh": "餐飲收銀系統（POS）是做什麼的？"}, {"text": "How do we prevent insider misuse & fraud?", "en": "How do we prevent insider misuse & fraud?", "zh": "內部人員濫用與舞弊要怎麼防？"}, {"text": "What should I do next?", "en": "What should I do next?", "zh": "接下來要去哪？"}], "trace": {"session": "offline", "lang": "en", "model": "qwen3.5:9b", "timings": {"route_s": 0.0, "tool_s": 0.01, "answer_s": 8.43, "total_s": 8.45}, "route": {"tool": "room_overview", "target": "", "how": "button"}, "link": {"query": "(current room)", "chosen": "bar", "how": "current room"}, "redirect": "", "queries": [{"purpose": "everything placed in this room", "cypher": "MATCH (r:Room {key:$k}) RETURN r {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh} AS r, [(r)-[:IN_AREA]->(a) | a {.key, .name_en, .name_zh}][0] AS area, [(r)-[:CLOSEUP_OF]->(p) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh}][0] AS parent, [(s:System)-[:LOCATED_IN]->(r) | s {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS systems, [(t:Threat)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | t {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS threats, [(c:Control)-[:SEEN_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .type}] AS controls, [(c:Concept)-[:TAUGHT_IN]->(r) | c {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh}] AS concepts, [(p:Procedure)-[:PRACTISED_IN]->(r) | p {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .kind}] AS procedures, [(d:Department)-[:BASED_IN]->(r) | d {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .desc_en, .desc_zh, .ext}] AS departments, [(cs:CaseStudy)-[:SHOWN_IN]->(r) | cs {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .year}] AS cases, [(r)-[l:LINKS_TO]->(x) | x {.key, .name_en, .name_zh, .it_en, .it_zh, .tour, .url, .url_index, .area, .kind, .story, .theme_en, .theme_zh, .lesson_en, .lesson_zh, teleport: l.teleport}] AS exits, size([(f:Finding)-[:IN_ROOM]->(r) | f]) AS findings_here", "params": {"k": "bar"}, "rows": 1, "ms": 6.6}], "graph": {"nodes": [{"key": "bar", "label": "Room", "en": "Bar", "zh": "酒吧"}, {"key": "pos", "label": "System", "en": "Point of Sale (POS)", "zh": "餐飲收銀系統（POS）"}, {"key": "erp", "label": "System", "en": "ERP · Inventory & Purchasing", "zh": "ERP 庫存與採購"}, {"key": "insider_fraud", "label": "Threat", "en": "Insider Misuse & Fraud", "zh": "內部人員濫用與舞弊"}, {"key": "sod", "label": "Control", "en": "Segregation of Duties", "zh": "職務分離"}, {"key": "c_erp", "label": "Concept", "en": "Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP)", "zh": "企業資源規劃（ERP）"}, {"key": "c_audit_trail", "label": "Concept", "en": "Audit Trail", "zh": "稽核軌跡"}], "edges": [{"a": "pos", "t": "SENDS_TO", "b": "erp"}, {"a": "pos", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "bar"}, {"a": "erp", "t": "LOCATED_IN", "b": "bar"}, {"a": "insider_fraud", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "pos"}, {"a": "insider_fraud", "t": "TARGETS", "b": "erp"}, {"a": "insider_fraud", "t": "SHOWN_IN", "b": "bar"}, {"a": "c_erp", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "bar"}, {"a": "c_erp", "t": "RELATED_TO", "b": "erp"}, {"a": "c_audit_trail", "t": "TAUGHT_IN", "b": "bar"}, {"a": "sod", "t": "SEEN_IN", "b": "bar"}, {"a": "sod", "t": "PROTECTS", "b": "erp"}, {"a": "sod", "t": "MITIGATES", "b": "insider_fraud"}]}, "tool_used": "room_overview", "facts": "Room: Bar Inventory & ERP\nWhat it shows: Every bottle is scanned into the ERP; POS sales reduce stock and low stock creates purchase orders to suppliers.\nKey lesson: Audit trails and segregation of duties stop one person from both counting and adjusting stock.\nSystems here: Point of Sale (POS), ERP · Inventory & Purchasing\nThreats shown here: Insider Misuse & Fraud\nControls you can see: Segregation of Duties\nConcepts: Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP), Audit Trail\nExits: Staff Corridor & Physical Security, Bar Close-up · Scanner & Stock Screen (called 'Bar · Up Close' in the tour), Restaurant POS", "answer_stats": {"model": "qwen3.5:9b", "wall_s": 8.43, "load_s": 0.0, "prompt_tokens": 579, "prompt_s": 2.48, "gen_tokens": 87, "gen_s": 5.02, "tok_per_s": 17.3, "first_token_s": 3.41}}, "state": {}}

